Subject: [PATCH 1/8] arm64: dts: qcom: sm8750: add Realme GT7 Pro (pista) full board DTS

Add Adreno 830 GPU/GMU/GXCLKCTL nodes to sm8750.dtsi and add the full
Realme GT7 Pro (pista, RMX5010) device tree with:
- USB 2.0 dual-role OTG + Type-C UCSI PMIC GLINK connector
- WCN7860 Wi-Fi 7 & Ganges 2.0 Bluetooth 6.0 (UART14 @ 8 Mbps)
- Synaptics S3910 SPI touchscreen & physical volume/power keys
- Adreno 830 GPU + native DPU 12.0 + DSI0 + AB849 120Hz DSC OLED display
- ADSP AudioReach (80.5 MiB adspslpi_mem), dual NXP TFA9874 speakers, WCD9395 dual mics
- PM8550 rear flashlight/torch LED (single populated channel 1)
- Qualcomm Iris VPU 3.5 hardware video decoder/encoder (&iris + &videocc)
- SPI5 IR blaster (&spi5 gpio53 MOSI + PM8550 L9B 2.504V + ir-spi-led)
- 95C passive thermal cooling-maps for Adreno 830 and Oryon CPU clusters
---
